!ClassOrganizer methodsFor: 'method dictionary'!addCategory: heading 
	"Add a new category named heading. If default category exists and is 
	empty, remove it. If default category exists and is not empty, assume it 
	is the last category and the new one is inserted before it. Otherwise the 
	new category is inserted at the end."

