		5
			0 request
			1 answer
		6-15
			inclusive byte length of operation block"

	page pupTypeGet: LeafType.

	"make operation a request, preserve length set earlier"
	page at: 25 put: ((page at: 25) bitAnd: 3) + (com bitShift: 3).

