	Pen new dragon: 8. 
	"!filberts: n side: s 
	"Two Hilbert curve fragments form a Hilbert tile. Draw four interlocking 
	tiles of order n and sides length s. Write directly into the display's 
	bitmap only."

	| n2 |
	Display white.
	n2 _ 1 bitShift: n - 1.
	self up; go: 0 - n2 * s; down.
