	(Pen new) hilbert: 3 side: 8. 
	(Pen new sourceForm: Cursor wait) combinationRule: Form under; 
	hilbert: 3 side: 25.
	"!hilberts: n 
	"Demonstrate the space-filling nature of Hilbert curves by drawing n 
	levels of nested curves on the screen. Write directly into the display's 
	bitmap only."

