			[:i | 
			self color: npoints // 2 - i * 20 \\ 250.
			1 to: npoints do: 
				[:j | 
				self place: (points at: j).
				self goto: (points at: j + i - 1 \\ npoints + 1)]]
	" 
	Pen new mandala: 30 diameter: 400. 
	"!spiral: n angle: a 
	"Draw a double squiral (see Papert, MindStorms), where each design is 
	made by moving the receiver a distance of n after turning the amount + 
	or -a."

	1 to: n do: 
		[:i | 
		self color: i * 2 \\ 256.
		self go: i; turn: a]

	"Display white. Pen new spiral: 200 angle: 89; home; spiral: 200 angle: -89"! !
